stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Question: TrialIQ guided question
    Question --> Intent: LLM structured intent
    Intent --> Retrieval: MCP bounded graph retrieval
    Retrieval --> Metrics: deterministic comparisons
    Metrics --> CandidateGate

    state CandidateGate <<choice>>
    CandidateGate --> Validation: candidate_count <= 6
    CandidateGate --> ReviewRequired: candidate_count > 6

    ReviewRequired --> Selected: Investigator chooses Analyse selected
    ReviewRequired --> All: Investigator chooses Analyse all
    Selected --> ReuseRetrieval: apply selected NCT IDs
    All --> ReuseRetrieval: keep all discovered candidates
    ReuseRetrieval --> Validation: no repeated intent/retrieval

    Validation --> Synthesis: evidence can synthesize
    Validation --> TerminalEvidenceState: evidence cannot synthesize
    Synthesis --> Result: LLM structured grounded synthesis
    TerminalEvidenceState --> Result
    Result --> [*]
